# コア — 実在の寸法で組む
#
# **エレベーターは 1600kg級 (かご2150×1600 / 昇降路2800×2400)。1機=1室、3室並び=1スパン。**
# バンクは対面 (南列3台+北列3台) で、乗場ホール幅 4,200。シャフトの奥行は実寸の
# 2,400 で、背後の1,800はEPS・PS・DSの帯 — 竪穴は乗場の裏に束ねるのが実務の形。
#
# A棟コア帯: X4..X10 × Y7..Y8+4200 (50.4m × 12.6m = 635㎡ / 板の28%)。
# スリムな塔はコア率が上がる — 貸室率 (レンタブル比) が下がるのはその代償で、
# 「板を細くして上に積む」ことの実際の勘定である。
#
# 階段は 2,800 × 6,000 の塊 (幅1,200の折返し)。走りはX方向。

# ---- A棟コア (B2〜R1) ----
# 南列: 設備帯 (奥) + シャフト (手前=ホール側)
space /B2..R1/aeps1 shaft X5..X7 Y7..Y7+1800 h:2800 name:A棟EPS・PS南 use:common
space /B2..R1/aevLs1 shaft X5..X5+2800 Y7+1800..Y7+4200 name:A棟低層EV南1 use:common lift:1
space /B2..R1/aevLs2 shaft X5+2800..X5+5600 Y7+1800..Y7+4200 name:A棟低層EV南2 use:common lift:1
space /B2..R1/aevLs3 shaft X5+5600..X6 Y7+1800..Y7+4200 name:A棟低層EV南3 use:common lift:1
space /B2..R1/aevHs1 shaft X6..X6+2800 Y7+1800..Y7+4200 name:A棟高層EV南1 use:common lift:1
space /B2..R1/aevHs2 shaft X6+2800..X6+5600 Y7+1800..Y7+4200 name:A棟高層EV南2 use:common lift:1
space /B2..R1/aevHs3 shaft X6+5600..X7 Y7+1800..Y7+4200 name:A棟高層EV南3 use:common lift:1
space /B2..L34/ast1 stair X4..X4+7000 Y7+1400..Y7+4200 name:A棟階段1 use:common stair:E form:return
space /R1/ast1t service X4..X4+7000 Y7+1400..Y7+4200 name:階段1塔屋 use:common
space /B2..R1/aps1 shaft X4..X4+7000 Y7..Y7+1400 h:2800 name:A棟PS1 use:common
space /B2..R1/agomi service X4+7000..X5 Y7..Y7+4200 h:2800 name:A棟ごみ置場 use:common
space /B2..R1/afr1 shaft X7..X7+2800 Y7+1800..Y7+4200 name:A棟荷物用EV1 use:common lift:1
space /B2..R1/afr2 shaft X7+2800..X7+5600 Y7+1800..Y7+4200 name:A棟荷物用EV2 use:common lift:1
space /B2..R1/ads1 shaft X7..X7+5600 Y7..Y7+1800 h:2800 name:A棟DS南 use:common
space /B2..R1/awcm service X7+5600..X8+4200 Y7..Y7+4200 h:2800 name:A棟男子便所 use:common
space /B2..R1/awcw service X8+4200..X10 Y7..Y7+4200 h:2800 name:A棟女子便所 use:common

# 北列
space /B2..R1/asto service X4..X5 Y8..Y8+4200 h:2800 name:A棟倉庫・メール use:common
space /B2..R1/aeps2 shaft X5..X7 Y8+2400..Y8+4200 h:2800 name:A棟EPS・PS北 use:common
space /B2..R1/aevLn1 shaft X5..X5+2800 Y8..Y8+2400 name:A棟低層EV北1 use:common lift:1
space /B2..R1/aevLn2 shaft X5+2800..X5+5600 Y8..Y8+2400 name:A棟低層EV北2 use:common lift:1
space /B2..R1/aevLn3 shaft X5+5600..X6 Y8..Y8+2400 name:A棟低層EV北3 use:common lift:1
space /B2..R1/aevHn1 shaft X6..X6+2800 Y8..Y8+2400 name:A棟高層EV北1 use:common lift:1
space /B2..R1/aevHn2 shaft X6+2800..X6+5600 Y8..Y8+2400 name:A棟高層EV北2 use:common lift:1
space /B2..R1/aevHn3 shaft X6+5600..X7 Y8..Y8+2400 name:A棟高層EV北3 use:common lift:1
space /B2..L34/ast2 stair X7..X7+7000 Y8..Y8+2800 name:A棟階段2 use:common stair:E form:return
space /R1/ast2t service X7..X7+7000 Y8..Y8+2800 name:階段2塔屋 use:common
space /B2..R1/aps2 shaft X7..X7+7000 Y8+2800..Y8+4200 h:2800 name:A棟PS2 use:common
space /B2..R1/autl service X7+7000..X8+4200 Y8..Y8+4200 h:2800 name:A棟湯沸・掃除 use:common
space /B2..R1/asec service X8+4200..X10 Y8..Y8+4200 h:2800 name:A棟リフレッシュ use:common

# 乗場ホール — 対面バンクの間、幅4,200
space /B2..R1/ahall corridor X4..X10 Y7+4200..Y8 h:2800 name:A棟EVホール use:common

